WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.260
Two friends imagine winning the lottery.

2
00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:07.590
Co byś zrobił, gdybyś wygrał milion?

3
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:12.160
Gdybym wygrał milion, kupiłbym dom nad jeziorem.

4
00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:15.170
A ja podróżowałabym po świecie.

5
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.880
Gdybym miał więcej czasu, pojechałbym w góry.

6
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:26.800
For a real possibility, use if with the normal tenses.

7
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:32.150
For an imagined one, a different word and the conditional.

8
00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:38.790
Igor would buy a house by a lake. What does he say?

9
00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:45.210
Gdybym wygrał milion, kupiłbym dom nad jeziorem.

10
00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:49.570
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

11
00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:55.290
Gdybym wygrał milion, kupiłbym dom nad jeziorem.

12
00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:00.690
If it rains tomorrow, we will stay at home.

13
00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:06.430
Jeśli jutro będzie padać, zostaniemy w domu.

14
00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:10.790
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

15
00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:15.830
Jeśli jutro będzie padać, zostaniemy w domu.

16
00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:21.390
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
